    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000t30r](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000t30r) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jul 24 2026 26km SE of Waff. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -2.5572 longitude 138.8159. It impacted 7206 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
